WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.241
Catalan's constant is irrational.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.110
One minus a ninth plus a twenty-fifth,

3
00:00:05.110 --> 00:00:07.090
and so on. Never proved irrational.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.979
Suppose it were a fraction. Two bounds

5
00:00:10.979 --> 00:00:12.846
on giant determinants would then cross.

6
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.094
Claimed: it is not a fraction at all.

7
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:19.032
Lean: main theorem.
